  "about_item": [
    "【Do you have a Dog?】.-----. When you try to cut his nails. He makes a lot of noise and sometimes tries to bite you so it’s a gamble as to whether or not you’ll keep your fingers if you’re trimming his nails. This TVIAOH dog muzzle fits well, and it does keep dog from fighting us. dog muzzles to prevent biting.",
    "【Humane Dog Muzzle - Medium】.-----. The material felt decent and did not seem to irritate our dog, and it was pretty easy to put the muzzle on him. This muzzle also, when put on the dog correctly, still allows for the dog to pant, drink, and eat treats. It is extremely important for the dog to be able to open their mouth enough to pant. That is how they cool themselves, instead of swearing like hoomans do.",
    "【Remember to Reward Your Dog】.-----. Use it when needed, and give plenty of breaks where you remove it for some time. Dog tried to scratch it off at first and couldn’t, but she soon got used to its comfort.These are not intended to be used as punishment or discipline. Don't forget to reward your dog every time you put it on especially if they haven't worn a muzzle. muzzle for dogs. Muzzle for dog. no barking muzzle",
    "【Safe Guard for Dogs】.-----. They are for training and for necessary and legit reasons, to protect yourself, and others, from injury. The dog muzzles is very thoughtfully designed and effectively prevents it from biting, barking, making our walks safer and more enjoyable. We only use it to prevent her reaction to triggers. If your dog gets very aggressive when it comes to grooming, vets, nail clipping, etc. This works great to stop her from hurting anyone. Very useful in difficult situations.",
    "【Secure and Adjustable Fit】.-----. Functional, durable, effective.This thoughtfully designed muzzle combines security, breathability, and ease of use to create a stress-free experience for both pets and their owners. It is adjustable, the velcro is great quality. The adjustable muzzle piece is a great design and perfect. It allows you to get a comfortable fit for your dog while providing a little size adjustment. A humane way to silence a yapping dog and that it didn't harm our canine."
  ],
